00:22:38.380 --> 00:22:40.260
You'll be here after I'm gone, I guess,

00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:42.520
but I can see it coming for you.

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:46.240
Yeah, I can. Let's look over here.

00:22:47.310 --> 00:22:49.670
In your neighborhood right now, there's erosion going on.

00:22:50.260 --> 00:22:54.240
And this scene today will never be exactly like this again.

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:55.960
It's eroding.
